CITATION

This code accompanies a research paper. Every dataset it evaluates is public,
and the code is released under the permissive terms above so that the benchmark
can be re-run, extended and disputed freely.

If you use this code, or results produced with it, please cite the paper. See
CITATION.cff for the machine-readable record.

The four datasets carry their own licences and data use agreements, two of them
requiring an access request. Nothing here redistributes any of them, and using
this code does not grant you rights to the data; honour each dataset's terms
separately.
